	"We have a special going on.\n"
	"If you deposit enough POKéMON,\l"
	"you'll get a special reward!\p"

	"How many POKéMON do you need to\n"
	"deposit for the prize?\p"

	"{PAUSE 30}Sixteen thousand.\n"
	"{PAUSE 45}and twenty.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


